# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ISWDP Cohort 6 (Advanced) — repository hygiene
#
# This file is deliberately explicit. Most of what it excludes is not clutter:
# it is third-party software, copyrighted course material, or personal data that
# must not be published. See PROVENANCE.md for the reasoning.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Third-party software and installers (not redistributable) -------------
*.exe
*.msi
*.iso
*.dmg
*.bin
*.run
VMware-*/
VMware-*

# --- Virtual machine images and guest state --------------------------------
*.vmdk
*.vmx
*.vmxf
*.vmsd
*.nvram
*.vmem
*.vmss
*.vmtm
*.vswp
*.lck/
virtual_machine*/

# --- Copyrighted course material -------------------------------------------
# Lecture decks, session captures and the supplied SWB reference project
# database. The program's own guidelines prohibit redistributing session
# content, and the decks are Synopsys copyright.
Study_Materials/
ISWDP_AdvanceLevel/
slides/
lecture*/
*class_slides*
Screenshot*.png
Screenshot*.jpg

# --- Synopsys-shipped files -------------------------------------------------
*.par
sdevice.par
models.par
runlimits.xml

# --- Textbooks and reference PDFs (not mine to distribute) ------------------
Neamen.pdf
*textbook*.pdf

# --- Personal data: do not publish -----------------------------------------
# Invoices, payment receipts, consent forms and program correspondence contain
# email, phone number, transaction and registration identifiers.
*invoice*
*Invoice*
*receipt*
*Consent*
*consent*
*Gmail*
*.eml
*.msg

# --- Bookmarks / shortcuts --------------------------------------------------
*.url
*.lnk
*.webloc

# --- TCAD run artefacts ----------------------------------------------------
# Raw simulation output is large, machine-specific and regenerable. Node
# databases, meshes, logs and plot data stay local.
*.tdr
*.grd
*.dat
*.plt
*.plx
*.sav
*.out
*.log
*.err
*.cmd.bak
n[0-9]*_*.cmd
gtree.dat
gvars.dat
gexec*
pp*.cmd
results/
nodes/
STDB/
*.mesh
*.bnd

# --- Licence files and host configuration ----------------------------------
*.lic
*license*
*.flexlm
snpslmd*

# --- OS / editor noise -----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
*.tmp

# --- Explicit allow-list overrides ------------------------------------------
# The curated assets that ARE part of this repository must survive the broad
# patterns above.
!screenshots/**/*.png
!reference/**/*.png
!certificates/**/*.pdf
